<title>USA: Brown &amp; Sharpe buys venture partner's stake.</title>
<headline>Brown &amp; Sharpe buys venture partner's stake.</headline>
<dateline>NORTH KINGSTWON, R.I. 1997-07-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brown &amp; Sharpe Manufacturing Co said Monday that it purchased the 50 percent interest in Automation Software Inc of its joint venture partner, Analysis &amp; Technology Inc, for $3 million.</p>
<p>Automation, which develops measurement software and provides training and services to manufacturing industries, had revenues of $11 million for the year ended March 31.</p>
<p>Brown &amp; Sharpe now owns 100 percent of Automation Sofware.</p>
